s": 2, "playtime_forever": 11920, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5144, "last_played": 1766502981, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Game is the gift that keeps on giving; with constant updates and new content (primarily variant bosses) being added every week.  Also, with rumors of a ranked system on the horizon things are only looking even brighter.", "timestamp_created": 1755299490, "timestamp_updated": 1755299490, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "202213147", "author": {"steamid": "76561198801153021", "personaname": "Rat Bomba", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198801153021/", "num_games_owned": 671, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 10163, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 10042, "deck_playtime_at_review": 9410, "last_played": 1764875680, "avatar": "dac955a3ede7b627c5d5703250a8b41a8e01bb9c"}, "language": "english", "review": "There is limited randomization and connection issues pop up with varying frequency, but the core gameplay is delightful and all of the nightfarers are a blast to play", "timestamp_created": 1755299104, "timestamp_updated": 1755299104, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": true, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "202212665", "author": {"steamid": "76561199480807133", "personaname": "shrekyboy_00", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199480807133/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 38, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 38, "last_played": 1755297661, "avatar": "812da374534b6ba45890157296606706fe8b02e6"}, "language": "english", "review": "if you like fort or cod buy it if you like souls game don't buy", "timestamp_created": 1755298457, "timestamp_updated": 1755298457, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.361544787883758545", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "202212194", "author": {"steamid": "76561198162981886", "personaname": "sortofsleepy", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198162981886/", "num_games_owned": 71, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 18460, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9200, "last_played": 1770350379, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "[h1]Even fun solo! But some stuff could be better[/h1]\n\nJust 100%'d the game today and beat all the Nightlords including all the Everdark(the ones that have been released so far) versions solo. I didn't buy the DLC add-on with my original purchase and was a bit skeptical about how much I'd get out of the game when I started; that said I enjoyed things enough that I grabbed DLC today. \n\nI haven't done multiplayer at all so this is coming from a solo player's perspective and someone that hasn't really played rogue-likes before. I'm also going to keep this short, these are just some thoughts off the top of my head.\n\n[h2] The good stuff [/h2]\n[list]\n[*] It's nice not having to worry about specific attributes to level up\n\n[*] A reasonably good variety of enemies\n\n[*] A good variety of different characters for different play styles. \n\n[*] Adding random events like the boss invasions was an interesting experience; sometimes it's great(like with Gnoster cause it's easy and you can grab a ton of runes), sometimes it's a bit of a pain(like Morgot though you get an ok buff afterwards) \n[/list]\n\n[h2] The bad stuff[/h2]\n[list]\n[*] Leveling up solo, even with the rune buff patch, is a bit difficult and really forces you to make some tough choices when routing depending on your skill level. I don't think I managed to hit 15 more than twice and 1 of those times I got lucky with the Gnoster rune buff. Usually I ended up around level 12-13, occasionally 14.\n\n[*] It can get repetitive. I'm not sure how things are getting randomized but it's not random enough. \n\n[*] I wish failing a Nightlord fight didn't require you to start a completely new expedition. I think it'd be better to punish the player in some way vs making them start things over from the beginning.\n\n[*] The evergols feel a little half-baked; without the relic buff I don't know that there'd be much point in scrounging up a key just to get extra runes compared to fighting say, a Crucible Knight or a couple field bosses.\n\n[*] The difficulty of the Nightlords was kind of interesting, not necessarily in a good way. Most were fine but there were some that felt almost too easy like Augur and Caligo. \n[/list]\n\nThat all said overall I did enjoy my time and look forward to the DLC.", "timestamp_created": 1755297821, "timestamp_updated": 1755310715, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "202212024", "author": {"steamid": "76561198129786179", "personaname": "oomfie", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/KayCaffeine/", "num_games_owned": 171, "num_reviews": 29, "playtime_forever": 5170, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2168, "last_played": 1765934382, "avatar": "7db4dffc7af0ea2e836e0fc97945c5fca91c3c94"}, "language": "english", "review": "w", "timestamp_created": 1755297591, "timestamp_updated": 1755297591, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "202211891", "author": {"steamid": "76561199016810974", "personaname": "Ki", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199016810974/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 12066, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 8487, "last_played": 1780848978, "avatar": "8fb505e3edab5c0a41cfb4f6ff979d100be1c903"}, "language": "english", "review": "WTF Enhanced Libra?", "timestamp_created": 1755297434, "timestamp_updated": 1755297434, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "202211747", "author": {"steamid": "76561198046308172", "personaname": "Clippy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ClippyAllTheWay/", "num_games_owned": 342, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 7914, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5781, "deck_playtime_at_review": 5781, "last_played": 1764940600, "avatar": "b1b2ef1484c85d3aa99b5387dd2d2e920d024913"}, "language": "english", "review": "Money well spent!\r\nFell in love with the gameplay and it even sparked a light for me to replay regular ER again when im not on this.\r\nHave gotten all the achievements and still see myself playing this for hours on end.\r\nWith duo mode it got even more intresting if you dont are a full crew to play with.\r\nCant wait to see what the DLC has in store. But for now we are showing who the real nightlords are.", "timestamp_created": 1755297251, "timestamp_updated": 1755297251, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": true, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "202211610", "author": {"steamid": "76561198084493567", "personaname": "Dray", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/rdray3/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 8222, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7723, "last_played": 1756244095, "avatar": "fe639691663abb66576bc5ed99ecff8c8296e8fe"}, "language": "english", "review": "its good", "timestamp_created": 1755297062, "timestamp_updated": 1755297062, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "202211062", "author": {"steamid": "76561199862951294", "personaname": "zaidubi35", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199862951294/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 3594, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1973, "last_played": 1775202326, "avatar": "978931ff2d774c665a91b9fa83c8a6a8666dca91"}, "language": "english", "review": "nice", "timestamp_created": 1755296357, "timestamp_updated": 1755296357, "voted_u